{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into a fusion of classic RPG and deckbuilding, where epic adventures meet strategic card battles. Ascend the Tower of Legends, build your own deck, confront fearsome monsters, and forge your own destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331480/extras/anim.heart.decay.gif?t=1751281912\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">LIFE IN THE CARDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331480/extras/LifeInCardsUpper.gif?t=1751281912\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331480/extras/LifeInCardsLower.gif?t=1751281912\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Health is a valuable resource in this game. Every card played exacts a toll on your health points, making every decision a high-stakes gamble. Choose your moves wisely, as you must balance power with preservation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">UNIQUE DECK BUILDING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331480/extras/BuildUniqueDecksEquip.gif?t=1751281912\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect a vast array of cards during your journey, each with its own set of abilities and consequences. Your deck evolves as you progress, reflecting your character's growth and adaptability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ALTER THE RULES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331480/extras/WorldCardsCrop.gif?t=1751281912\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use world cards to change the rules of the game and raid the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">VARIABLE DIFFICULTY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331480/extras/DifficultySelectionCrop.gif?t=1751281912\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ensures that the game can be played by newcomers and veterans alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">PROCEDURALLY GENERATED FLOORS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Brace yourself for an ever-changing challenge. Each floor of the Tower is procedurally generated, ensuring that no two runs are the same. Unearth hidden secrets, discover new strategies, and face unforeseen obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FRESH ART STYLE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Retro pixel art implemented in a 3D world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"ht